# A backend whose `Capabilities::describe` is false reports DS4001 at check time.
mode: check
schema: 'orders.csv'(orderId: string, amount: real)
without: operator describe
---- query
from 'orders.csv' | describe
---- expected
error[DS4001]: `describe` is not supported by this engine
  --> query:1:21
  |
1 | from 'orders.csv' | describe
  |                     ^^^^^^^^ this engine does not implement `describe`
